Well, that sounds like a nice mess you've gotten yourself into.
Hopefully you'll learn a few lessons from this.

1)  Be very careful with two handed weapons.  Especially in the
endgame.  Keep them blessed at all times.
2)  The Book of the Dead cannot be blanked or burned away.  The game
goes out of its way to not destroy stuff that lets you win the game.
If the book does fall in the moat, then freeze the water and the book
will be on top. (due to it not being able to be contained, like all the
invocation artifacts and the "oY)  One could also use an "oMB for
swimming, but freeze is usually a much better option.

Ok, the way I would get out of this would be to levelport to a place
where it's safe to pray.  This can be done easily if you have teleport
control...which I hope you have, and I hope your source isn't a ring!
Once you have a ring of TC one should be eating tengu meat in hopes of
getting intrinsic TC.  Read either a cursed scroll of teleport or a
non-cursed scroll of teleport while confused to do a levelport.   Even
if you lack control then hopefully you can get off this level and end
up below Vlad's tower.  If so, then just work your way up to Vlads, and
go there to pray.

Have fun!  (Oh, and I hope you have a way to re-bless that weapon
asap!)

